    <schema:description>Louie Doniego Balmores is a civil engineer based in Toronto, Ontario, Canada. Born June 26, 1991 in Tuguegarao City, Philippines. Registered Civil Engineer (Professional Regulation Commission, Philippines, November 2013, Sequence No. 350) with 10+ years of high-performance structural design. Founder of Balmores Lab — a research initiative on AI-driven structural optimization.</schema:description>

